## 🇬🇧 English

### What this feature adds

A shop panel with 5 upgrades that boost the player's click power:
- Upgrade 1: +1 click power (cost: 10)
- Upgrade 2: +2 click power (cost: 100)
- Upgrade 3: +5 click power (cost: 1,000)
- Upgrade 4: +10 click power (cost: 10,000)
- Upgrade 5: +25 click power (cost: 100,000)

Each upgrade is one-time purchase, saved via DataStore.

### Why it matters

- Adds progression to the game (players feel they grow)
- Creates a first goal loop: click → earn coins → buy upgrade → click harder → earn more
- Base foundation for all incremental mechanics that come next

### Prerequisites

- ✅ **P1 MVP-Clicker** installed first (this feature builds on it)

### Files in this folder

- **`Main.lua`** → paste in `ServerScriptService` (as a `Script`) — replaces the P1 Main.lua
- **`ClickHandler.lua`** → paste in `StarterPlayer` → `StarterPlayerScripts` (as a `LocalScript`) — replaces the P1 ClickHandler.lua

### Test it

1. Save both scripts
2. Hit **▶️ Play** in Studio
3. Click the CLIQUER button → earn coins
4. Click the 🛒 BOUTIQUE button → panel opens with 5 upgrades
5. Buy an upgrade → your click power increases

### 🎥 Watch the video

**TikTok Part 2:** [https://vm.tiktok.com/ZN88V8Bu8/](https://www.tiktok.com/@kevinpasflamboyant008)

### Known notes

- Upgrades don't stack (each one is one-time)
- Order of purchase doesn't matter
- Data persists across sessions via DataStore

